        "original_id": "b17287c4-b212-5d6e-a188-afbb1d0cba86",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Mark Huffam, Mike Jefferies, Matt Barrelle, Craig Heaney\n- Works: The Martian, Johnny English, Game of Thrones, Goal!, James Bond, Mr. Bean\n- Companies: Buena Vista Pictures\n- Topics: film and television production, spy comedy\n\nFacts:\n- Mark Huffam is a film and television producer.\n- Johnny English is a 2003 British-American spy comedy film that parodies the James Bond secret agent genre and uses comedy similar to Rowan Atkinson's Mr. Bean character.\n- Mark Huffam was a producer on Johnny English.\n- Mark Huffam, Mike Jefferies, and Matt Barrelle produced the film Goal!.\n- Buena Vista Pictures distributed Goal!.\n- Mark Huffam was a producer on The Martian.\n- Mark Huffam was a producer on the television series Game of Thrones.\n- The Craig Heaney sentence references a 2009 sequel, but the title is not present in the chunk.",
